   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "What time it is",
     "texto": [
      "**Сколько сейчас времени?** = what time is it?",
      "You answer with **сейчас** (now) and the time. The word **час** changes like **год**. From 1 to 20: 1 **час**, 2–4 **часа** and 5–20 **часов**. In compound numbers, look at the last digits: **21 час**, **22–24 часа**, **25 часов**; if the last two digits are 11–14, **часов** is used.",
      "**Сейчас час** (it is one o'clock; the number «one» is not said). **Сейчас два часа** (it is two o'clock). **Сейчас пять часов** (it is five o'clock)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
